2 09:30:10','2026-08-02 09:30:10'),(34,'01KZ973JDY3BV5GEWZ7J9YRZ8F',14,85,268,1,'Exactly what I needed — copied it straight into the project.','2026-08-03 16:27:04','2026-08-03 16:27:04'),(35,'01KZ973JEQMZXYNJ6MFSV4BD7B',15,86,274,1,'Clear, and it actually explained the reasoning instead of just dumping an answer.','2026-08-03 07:52:07','2026-08-03 07:52:07'),(36,'01KZ973JF9HRK3FHW2C4H7DBT7',16,87,278,-1,'Answer was fine but far longer than it needed to be.','2026-08-04 17:34:21','2026-08-04 17:34:21'),(37,'01KZ973JGZ9CNZATZWFFKWQAFE',20,91,290,1,'Saved me an afternoon of trial and error.','2026-08-05 13:06:07','2026-08-05 13:06:07'),(38,'01KZ973JK6TNJP80DD64S60WE2',25,96,306,1,'Saved me an afternoon of trial and error.','2026-08-05 09:39:51','2026-08-05 09:39:51');
